async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  720  gp</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>No special properties, beyond the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> enchantment.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>     \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Prior to Patch 6, this item was wielded by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/25px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/38px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/50px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hope\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/25px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\">Hope</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a> and could be looted if she was killed.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205929\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1738/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18725/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3862/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1603/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1091404/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.840      1 -total\n 56.54%   30.439      1 Template:Equipment_page\n 43.39%   23.361      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 42.71%   22.995      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 41.36%   22.268      1 Template:Ambox\n 21.55%   11.600      7 Template:Icon_text\n 16.73%    9.005     16 Template:Trim\n 13.43%    7.232      4 Template:Icon_link\n  9.17%    4.936      2 Template:WeaponType\n  8.60%    4.632      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30394-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714205929 and revision id 382314. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}